{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":25,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_damped_decay","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_damped_decay","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L103-L107","doc":"**Damped decay rate.** `γ_k = ν_q/2 · [k]_q² / L_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_undamped_dispersion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_undamped_dispersion","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L96-L101","doc":"**Undamped Kelvin dispersion.** `ω_k ∝ [k]_q / L_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_spectrum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_spectrum","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L90-L94","doc":"**Spectrum with units.** `λ_k = [k]_q² ℏ_q / L_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_dispersion_derivation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_dispersion_derivation","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L81-L88","doc":"**`q`-Laplacian eigenvalue.** `Δ_q(zᵏ) = -[k]_q² zᵏ` — the core of the\nmd derivation, *proved* from the `q`-derivative ladder and the\ndefinition `Δ_q = -(zD_q)²` ([`prop:kelvin-dispersion-derivation`]). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:kelvin-dispersion-derivation","label":"prop:kelvin-dispersion-derivation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.decay","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.decay","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L79-L79","doc":"**Damped decay rate.** `γ_k = ν_q/2 · [k]_q² / L_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.dispersion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.dispersion","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L77-L77","doc":"**Undamped dispersion.** `ω_k = Γ_q^{1/2}/(2√π a_q) · [k]_q / L_q`,\npackaged with `sqrtΓ_q` and `π` as opaque positive constants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.spectrum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.spectrum","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L74-L74","doc":"**Spectrum with units.** `λ_k = [k]_q² ℏ_q / L_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.laplacian_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.laplacian_def","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L72-L72","doc":"**Laplacian is `-(zD_q)²`.** The coefficient of `Δ_q(zᵏ)` is minus\nthe square of the `zD_q`-coefficient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.zDq_ladder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.zDq_ladder","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L69-L69","doc":"**`q`-derivative ladder.** `z D_q (zᵏ) = [k]_q zᵏ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.gamma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.gamma","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.omega","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.omega","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L66-L66","doc":"Undamped Kelvin dispersion frequency `ω_k` and damped decay rate `γ_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.sqrtPiConst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.sqrtPiConst","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L64-L64","doc":"`√π` as an opaque constant (so `2 √π a_q` reads `2 * sqrtPiConst * aq`).\nNamed `sqrtPiConst` (not `piConst`) to avoid collision with\n`AcousticHorizonContext.piConst`, which denotes `π` rather than `√π`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.nuq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.nuq","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.aq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.aq","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.sqrtGamma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.sqrtGamma","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Core radius `a_q`, viscosity `ν_q`, the positive constant\n`sqrtΓ_q = Γ_q^{1/2}`, and `√π` (kept as opaque positive reals so the\nderivation needs no analysis imports). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.lam","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.lam","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Eigenvalues of the `q`-Laplacian with physical units. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.Lq_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.Lq_pos","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.Lq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.Lq","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.hbar_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.hbar_pos","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.hbar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.hbar","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Quantum of action `ℏ_q > 0`, filament length `L_q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.laplacian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.laplacian","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Coefficient of `zᵏ` in `Δ_q (zᵏ) = -(z D_q)∘(z D_q)(zᵏ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.zDq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.zDq","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Coefficient of `zᵏ` in `z D_q (zᵏ)`. The md computes this `= [k]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.qInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.qInt","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The `q`-integer `[k]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionContext","kind":"class","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.lean#L37-L79","doc":"Data of the linearised Kelvin-wave problem on a filament: the\n`q`-integer `[k]_q`, the operator `zD_q` and the `q`-Laplacian `Δ_q`\n(as their action on the `k`-th mode, valued in the coefficient of\n`zᵏ`), the physical scales, and the dispersion / decay rates. ","signatureChunk":0}]}